# 1️⃣2️⃣ Assign Cookies

## 📖 Problem

Each child has:

```text
Greed Factor
```

Each cookie has:

```text
Size
```

A child is satisfied if:

```text
cookie size >= greed factor
```

Maximize satisfied children.

---

### Example

```text
Children:

1 2 3

Cookies:

1 1
```

Output:

```text
1
```

---

# 1️⃣3️⃣ Greedy Strategy

Sort:

```text
Children
Cookies
```

Use two pointers.

Always give:

```text
Smallest valid cookie
```

to the current child.

---

### C++ Code

```cpp
int findContentChildren(
    vector<int>& g,
    vector<int>& s)
{
    sort(g.begin(), g.end());
    sort(s.begin(), s.end());

    int child = 0;
    int cookie = 0;

    while(
        child < g.size() &&
        cookie < s.size()
    )
    {
        if(s[cookie] >= g[child])
        {
            child++;
        }

        cookie++;
    }

    return child;
}
```

### Complexity

```text
Time: O(N log N)

Space: O(1)
```

