# 1️⃣5️⃣ Greedy Strategy

Maintain:

```text
Number of $5 bills
Number of $10 bills
```

For:

```text
$20
```

Prefer:

```text
10 + 5
```

instead of:

```text
5 + 5 + 5
```

because larger bills are harder to break later.

---

### C++ Code

```cpp
bool lemonadeChange(
    vector<int>& bills)
{
    int five = 0;
    int ten = 0;

    for(int bill : bills)
    {
        if(bill == 5)
        {
            five++;
        }
        else if(bill == 10)
        {
            if(five == 0)
                return false;

            five--;
            ten++;
        }
        else
        {
            if(ten > 0 &&
               five > 0)
            {
                ten--;
                five--;
            }
            else if(five >= 3)
            {
                five -= 3;
            }
            else
            {
                return false;
            }
        }
    }

    return true;
}
```

### Complexity

```text
Time: O(N)

Space: O(1)
```

