# 💡 Interview Tips

✅ Sort first if the problem involves scheduling.

✅ Earliest finish time is a common greedy choice.

✅ Highest profit first often works in scheduling problems.

✅ Use two pointers after sorting.

✅ Track farthest reachable index in Jump Game.

✅ Prefer larger denomination usage in change-making problems.

---

# ⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Sorting by start time instead of finish time.

❌ Missing greedy proof.

❌ Using DP where a simple greedy works.

❌ Not updating farthest reach correctly.

❌ Giving change in the wrong order.

